==Battleground==
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sagat (Enemy)|Sagat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Sagat does pretty low damage, even with wave attacks. Use this to your advantage and send out tanky melee attackers such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] or disposable attackers such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat.]] Or use wave blockers/wave immune cats if you have them because they trivialize this stage.

